      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 LinkedIn Auto-Posting — Poora Process (Start → End)\n\n**Maqsad:** Har **Tue / Thu / Sat, shaam 5 PM** par khud-ba-khud LinkedIn par ek post — image + AI-generated caption.\n\n**Data source:** Google Sheet *\"LinkedIn Workflow Automation\"* (Sheet1). Har row = ek post.\nColumns: `Workflow` (naam) · `Description Topic` (tafseel) · `Image File Name` (Drive pic ka naam) · `Status` (khaali = pending / \"Posted\") · `Posted Date`.\n\n**Queue logic:** Sheet se pehli row jiska Status khaali ho utha kar post karta hai, phir \"Posted\" mark kar deta hai — agli baar apne aap agli pending row chali jaati hai.\n\n**Puora flow:**\n1️⃣ Schedule Trigger → 2️⃣ Sheet se pending row → 3️⃣ Drive se image dhoondo + download → 4️⃣ AI caption likho → 5️⃣ Merge (image+caption) → 6️⃣ LinkedIn post → 7️⃣ Sheet mein \"Posted\" mark.\n\n**Aapka kaam:** Bas nayi pics + descriptions sheet mein daalte rahein — baaki sab automatic.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      },
