      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "= Create a professional LinkedIn post about the automation workflow.\n\nWorkflow Name:\n{{ $node[\"Get Pending Workflow\"].json[\" Workflow\"] }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $node[\"Get Pending Workflow\"].json[\" Description Topic\"] }}\n\nWrite the post as if I personally built this workflow.\n\nExplain briefly:\n- What problem it solves\n- How the workflow works\n- How AI and n8n are used\n- What business benefit it provides\n\nKeep it professional, natural and engaging.\nUse a few relevant emojis.\nAdd 5-8 relevant hashtags.\n\nDo not make up features that are not mentioned in the workflow description.\n\nReturn ONLY the final LinkedIn post text. Do not include explanations or labels.",
